  "created": "2025-01-03T11:12:50.093Z",
  "description": "SI_Format allows strings like 21.34km be parsed to return a numerical value of 21,340 as a float, double or decimal. \n        SI_Format will also adjust the value of float, double or decimal such that 34,560 may be written as 34.56kB \n        where \"B\" was passed as the unit to use.\n        Some physical constants are provided for C# use.",
  "id": "SI_Format",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-01-03T11:15:26.9Z",
  "licenseFile": "license.txt",
