  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.5 is packaged for .Net6, .Net7, .Net8 or .Net9.\nThe SI_Format package has been reduced in size.\nThis version uses just two functions Parse and Format.\nInfoReg.SI_Format.Parse<double>(\"5nF\", out num);\nstring ans = InfoReg.SI_Format.Format<decimal>(\"12.345678912345678\", \"G21\", \"grams\");\nOlder functions like ParseDouble will work but are marked obsolete and will produce a \ncompiler error if used.",
